§§ `Section 337(b) — the Minister's order`

GIVEN m  IS A BOOLEAN
      a  IS A BOOLEAN
      bs IS A LIST OF `A branch of insurance`
      c  IS A BOOLEAN
      k  IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `An order changing the rates in Schedule J`
`an order by the Minister:` m `approved:` a `changing` bs `consulted:` c `consented:` k MEANS
    `An order changing the rates in Schedule J` WITH
        `made by the Minister`                                 IS m
        `approved by the Finance Committee of the Knesset`     IS a
        `branches whose rates it changes`                      IS bs
        `made after consultation with the Minister of Finance` IS c
        `made with the consent of the Minister of Finance`     IS k

#ASSERT     `s 337(b) — the order is within the Minister's power` (`an order by the Minister:` TRUE `approved:` TRUE `changing` (LIST `maternity`) `consulted:` FALSE `consented:` FALSE)
