#ASSERT REFUSED `s 334(a)(1) — the threshold on 1 January of` 2027 `from` 8000 `by the index from` 100 `to` 99 BECAUSE "section 334(a) updates the threshold by the rate of rise of the index or of the average wage, and says nothing of a fall"
-- The average wage falls, 10,000 to 9,900, from 8,000 in 2029: rate of rise −100 / 10,000 = −0.01.
--   (i) 8,000 − 80 = 7,920; (ii) 8,000; (iii) declined, and so by default.
